      "Config": {"Item":true,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::536141479",
      "Source": "Equip a Hatzegopteryx with this to ride it. Saddle is equipped with Element-powered thrusters, enabling the Hatzegopteryx to fly significantly faster while they are active. In addition to Element, the saddle may fall back onto other fuel types with varying efficiency. However, the Hatzegopteryx may be unable to use its grab attacks.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"装备到哈特兹哥翼龙上以骑乘。该鞍具配备有以元素为动力的推进器，当其激活时可使哈特兹哥翼龙飞行速度显著加快。除了元素，该鞍具还可使用其他燃料，但效率各异。然而，哈特兹哥翼龙可能无法使用其抓取攻击。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::3176716341",
      "Source": "Hatzegopteryx Lost Knight Saddle",
      "Trans": {"SC":"哈特兹哥翼龙失落骑士鞍","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":true,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::2077696545",
      "Source": "Hatzegopteryx Platform Saddle",
      "Trans": {"SC":"哈特兹哥翼龙平台鞍","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":true,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::4180095080",
      "Source": "Equip a Hatzegopteryx with this to ride it.  You can build structures on the platform to make a mobile base.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"装备到哈特兹哥翼龙上以骑乘。你可以在平台上建造建筑，使其成为一个移动基地。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::758642760",
      "Source": "Cracked Alpha Karkinos Claw",
      "Trans": {"SC":"开裂的精英巨蟹鳌","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":true,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::3538730296",
      "Source": "A hefty claw cracked open with the help of an Aberrant Hatzegopteryx's beak. This is a meal fit for a king! Eat it yourself, or feed it to a dino. Effects last 15 minutes.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"在畸变哈特兹哥翼龙的喙的帮助下撬开的巨大蟹鳌。这是一顿适合国王的美餐！你可以自己吃，或者喂给恐龙。效果持续15分钟。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
